      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nabaza ati, “Kanatambize nyinainywe, nkamuha baruaki ey'okumutambya. Elihai? Anga n'ohai ayabaire nantonga kugira muti nkamubaguza? Okugya omu buzahe mukaturwa amafu ganyu. Na nyinainywe okutambibwa akazira entambara zanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubaki orwo naizire tinaboine muntu? Orwo nayesire ow'okunyetaba nk'atazokire? Tinkiina bushobora bwa kubachungura? Anga amani g'okubarokora nigo ntainago? Leba, kandikwatanguka, enyanja eyoma, emiiga liba irungu ly'omushenye, enfuru ezaba zili omu miga egyo ziburwa amaizi, zitwa eiliho, zinuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninshobora kwiraguza eiguru likashusha elyaferwa, oti nilichulira ayafa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga ampaire okugamba nk'omuntu ayegire, nshobore kugambira alemirwe, kumugumisa. Buli bwankya Omukama anyimukya, mutega amatwi nk'omwegesibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga anyigwire amatwi; kandi nanye tinamushenga anga kumuhwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanteire nkabatega omugongo; banyurura omuleju nabatega n'emba. Bakanchwera banjangura, kyonkai tinayebunzire aha maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga n'iwe aba mujuni wange; niyo nshonga nchuleire ntekaine; aha maisho naguma nk'enkangabuye, mara nimanya okwo ntalishonara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andamulira ali haihi, n'ohai ow'okukwatangana nanye? Tutoijanyie! Omubisha wange n'ohai, angobe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, Omukama Ruhanga n'iwe aba mujuni wange; ow'okunkwata omushango ali nkahai? Bona abalikumpatiika balihwaho, tulishusha omwendo guliirwe enyenje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo muli n'ohai alikutina Omukama, akahulira n'ebyo omwiruwe alikugamba? Omuntu alikusigiilira eby'amazima akakora ebitalibyo, ayesige Omukama, ayekwate Ruhangawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, inywena nimuhemba omuliro, mwakize enkanzi! Omuliro ogwo mwahemba gubaakize mugende, mugende mukwete enkanzi ezo mwahemba! Omu bushobora bwange ndibabonabonyia. Mulifa kubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
